					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Like, what I really wanted to know was, is there something embedded in his palm, or is there something growing out of it? And I think you could have conveyed that much without telling us what, exactly, was there. Knowing there's a thing growing out of this kid's hand that shouldn't be there is pretty freaky, after all.</p> 
				 	]]>
